    "Name": "Rotunda C Spycar",
    "Details": "This unique variant of the Rotunda C, used by James Knight, exchanges the four ER Small Lasers for a much higher rated Clan XXL engine and a single Clan Improved Heavy Medium Laser. The explosive nature of the heavy laser is mitigated by CASE protection. The extreme engine upgrade makes the CX ideal for extracting valuable contacts, and like the other Rotunda C variants it can hide behind interchangeable body kits.\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Biome Restrictions: None.</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Movement: 21/32 hexes / 630/960 meters.</color></b>\n\n<color=#ffcc00><b>Armor:</b> Ferro-Fibrous (C)\n<b>Structure:</b> Structure\n<b>Values       A        S  </b>\n<b>Front</b>       105      5\n<b>Left</b>          85      5\n<b>Right</b>        85      5\n<b>Rear</b>         80      5\n\n<b>Total</b>      355     20</color>\n\n<color=#ff0000>Quirk: Narrow/Low Profile</color>",
